# The 5.2 instance level for cells the RTLIL writer has no form for ($memrd, $memwr: memory ports
# before memory_collect). The netlist is read with -icells and written; only the text legs run
# (read, census, instances, library instances), there is no gold and no equivalence. No
# opt_clean: it removes a $memwr, which has no output.
read_verilog -icells @DESIGN@
proc
write_verilog @OUT@
